🟢 SYN Card: "Hello! I want to start a conversation."

🔵 ACK Card: "Understood! I heard what you just said."

🟡 FIN Card: "I have finished talking and want to say goodbye."

🔴 RST Card: "Error! Hang up immediately, something is wrong."

⚡ PSH Card: "Don't wait! Process this message right away."

🚨 URG Card: "Priority message! Read this before anything else."
